cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "OSA and heart failure: adiposity-shared genetic architecture"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a two-sample and multivariable Mendelian randomisation study
  examining whether the genetic association between obstructive sleep apnoea and
  heart failure is independent of adiposity. The analysis uses the MVP and
  FinnGen sleep-apnoea GWAS as exposure, HERMES and FinnGen heart failure as
  outcome, and BMI for multivariable adjustment.
